      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="kicker"><span class="grad">For doctors who teach</span>: courses, programs, memberships</p>
        <h1>
          <span class="line">Get <span class="num">3,000 to 5,000</span> followers</span>
          <span class="line">a month <span class="ul">who want</span></span>
          <span class="line"><span class="ul">what you've built.</span></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="sub">
          One filming day a month. We plan, script, edit and post, in your voice.
        </p>
