              <div class="field"><label for="f-phone">Phone</label><input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 555 123 4567" required /></div>
              <div class="field"><label for="f-ig">Instagram handle</label><div class="handle"><span>@</span><input id="f-ig" name="instagram" type="text" placeholder="yourhandle" required /></div></div>
              <p class="sms-consent full">
                By entering your phone number you agree to texts from Synchro Social about your
                application and call, including a reminder if you don't finish booking. Message
                frequency varies. Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.
