          <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><div class="st"><h3>We film a month of content</h3><p>One filming day a month. You show up and talk, and we handle the rest.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step"><div class="n">4</div><div class="st"><h3>We edit, test and post</h3><p>We post your videos on your profile, and make several versions of each one with different openings to show to people who don't follow you yet. We track which versions bring in the most new followers and make more of what works. You get a weekly report on what grew.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <p class="first-post">Your first post goes live 2 to 3 weeks after you start.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn" href="#apply">Book my call with Kasper</a>
